values ('b9c0d1e2-3f4a-4b24-9c63-7d8e9f0a1b14', 'event-and-meeting-management', 'Event and Meeting Management', 'This course prepares students to design, plan, sell, produce, operate, and evaluate meetings and events across hospitality settings. Students integrate event strategy, project management, finance, contracts, venue and destination analysis, program and experience design, catering, production, technology, marketing, registration, workforce leadership, risk, accessibility, sustainability, on-site command, and post-event evaluation. Through a semester-long client-style project and live operations simulations, students learn to make evidence-based decisions, coordinate diverse stakeholders, control scope and resources, protect participants, and deliver measurable value and positive impact.');

